{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ab3ea94c1f1d0fc1046a9cc5c3e723dc19969fac7ebfebcc78383bd09bdd5067", "ja": "（今日は、ひなたにとって初めてのオーディション。\n周囲に飲まれず、うまくやれるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（今天是日向第一次参加试镜。希望她不要被周围的人影响，能够顺利应对……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "47b2588ba8ac5e0d5e76e95a33238119b932e99ffc112492111d580071fe744d", "ja": "ひなた、さっきから難しい顔をしてるけど……\n緊張してるのか？", "zh": "日向，你从刚才开始就一直愁眉苦脸的……\n是紧张了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "383336578e5d57af6a7f7426026d3806d8b70615c33c3cb6c8e21be98359dd72", "ja": "ううん。\nあ、えっと。緊張は、してるんだけども……。", "zh": "不是的。\n啊，那个。虽然紧张确实也是紧张……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "4aa0d1e969e73b18033b9933742a87a129b83354cef23465599609caa940016d", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}……。\nあたし、ここにいないほうがいいんでないだろうか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}……\n我是不是不留在这里比较好呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "44921a5f3a25f0ef28f381631866a7c13d3d06ed869a5086624eec315e20b10a", "ja": "いないほうがいいって……突然、どうしたんだ？\n何か問題でもあるのか？", "zh": "不该留在这里……怎么突然这么说？\n是有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "e516aba5d43c08c545f564f88f9b9e6fbb7463e1eca2222fc882725d14f5ecde", "ja": "そういうわけじゃないんだけども……。会場にいる\n他のアイドルの子たちが、みんな真剣な顔してて……。", "zh": "倒也不是那个意思……只是，会场里的其他偶像女孩，个个都一脸认真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "642d1f63d39ec56a7242e5022982080e227987537a90ab338113ecbb75dd3967", "ja": "近くにいるだけで……みんなが今まで、どれだけ\nがんばってきたかが、伝わってくるんだわ……。", "zh": "光是待在她们身边……就能感受到大家至今为止有多么努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c8ad685cba77b91b0133a53c88135ed7f13c48030fdd97c6335c0f262f0f279", "ja": "なのに、合格できるのはたったの数人しょや？\nなんだかあたし、申し訳なくなってきてしまって……。", "zh": "可是，能合格的就只有那么几个人，对吧？  \n不知怎么的，我渐渐觉得很过意不去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9396f8fffbbd220a8d9d04be01c4150e10d71332a45c6ab40b4dfd1bcac9ffb9", "ja": "ひなた……。", "zh": "日向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "239952cf4da284cd8959daa607eaa4b4c12c66ab0a8f8e1b1d357b25c597693e", "ja": "（気持ちの優しいひなたは、他のアイドルと\n競い合う事に、気が引けてしまったようだ。でも……）", "zh": "（性格温柔的日向，似乎不太愿意和其他偶像竞争。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "dc81a2422c333c8a217001c8a348abdd80076e0ba1cf91db684378ff6d7e67e5", "ja": "みんなで仲良く合格ってわけには、\nいかないのかねぇ……。", "zh": "就不能大家和和气气地一起合格吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7166c4137f531659a9082e215532b0f3615097886119aabeab0cafa1a9ddb1ac", "ja": "そうだな。合格できて喜ぶ子もいれば、\n不合格になって悲しむ子もいるだろう。", "zh": "是啊。有的孩子会因为合格而高兴，\n也会有的孩子因落选而难过吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "1bad8a48e29886d3946bae810398d26b7117e9d65d9238b364ea2994c1b3168b", "ja": "うぅ……。{$P$}。\nオーディションって、厳しいんだねぇ……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}。\n试镜真是残酷啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1015_p", "source_sha256": "19dee2b3875036beb852ae2d9a1924a7c734b6df357b459e10783b55167c57ad", "ja": "確かに、厳しい世界だ。でも勝たないと、今回なら\nアイドルとして、歌を披露する場所がもらえないんだ。", "zh": "确实，这是个严酷的世界。但如果赢不了，这次的话，\n就没有机会作为偶像登台献歌了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "0c3c923dde92e6fe4ed9c7803b55b2de381dc8a645ea10c40217de3a33810597", "ja": "うん……。\nわかってるんだけども……。", "zh": "嗯……  \n我明白，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4827d066877d84ad107371765f50189460563d7d1554dc8be4a29930e4adbc03", "ja": "それに、不合格になる事だって、大事な経験なんだ。\n自分の経験、肥やしになるからな。", "zh": "而且，落选也是很重要的经历。\n会成为滋养自身成长的养分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "e3c5c5c7a9b5aa569bef0716406aa6ecf1ac00726cd010ff19143fd9fdb151cc", "ja": "大事な経験……不合格になることがかい？\nそうなんだろうか……。", "zh": "宝贵的经验……没能合格也是吗？\n是那样吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "936e23e4608d2bb14e69deec07887b273172980a823d565547e1a0d869828534", "ja": "ああ。だから、ひなたが合格する事で、\n他の子が成長する可能性もある。遠慮なく行ってこい！", "zh": "啊。所以，日向通过选拔的话，也有可能让其他孩子得到成长。别顾虑，放手去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "932fe8bbb0bf11f885a615773a7d9ddab500c221515677b818b6ba7928df9dbe", "ja": "うん……わかったよ、{$P$}。\nあたし、合格めざしてがんばるよぉ！", "zh": "嗯……我明白了，{$P$}。\n我会努力争取合格的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b5497a9b4e998036400f6efe9e1bd1e274605a60fe1e53b3b63b0147f2bd7338", "ja": "（その後、ひなたは全力でオーディションに挑んだが、\n審査の結果……不合格だった）", "zh": "（之后，日向全力以赴参加了试镜，可是根据评审结果……落选了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "e3e6687cf9e5be1ef45552115d53a54730cb72f31c2bee4c2d2f65904d87ea3b", "ja": "あたしなりにがんばったけども、落ちてしまったべさ。\n残念だったねぇ……。", "zh": "虽然我已经尽了自己的努力，可还是落选了。\n真遗憾啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1024_p", "source_sha256": "25da6db725b8f62ea36d7af6f005a0d7ca33550b3bdcc0729e93dff06ee93bd2", "ja": "（ひなたは不合格だったのに、なんだか嬉しそうだ。\nもしかして、勝たなかった事に安心している……？）", "zh": "（明明小日向没能合格，却不知为何一副很开心的样子。\n难道说，她是在为自己没有获胜而感到安心……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "7e3470d4cbd46685b554f204bebb597eaea30a6f3ea4a2c427ff3631e63ccabc", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\n今日、合格したあの子、泣いてたねぇ。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。\n今天那个合格的孩子，哭了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0871bac4c89fb5de8e9d960f28aa3834f62b3f353d87fc91131fe064270288aa", "ja": "うん、そうだったな。今までの努力が実って、\nきっと嬉しかったんだろうな。", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样。一直以来的努力终于有了回报，她一定很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "fc887c567fb8d29a651f6d8f3074ccf14003e5aa5a0eefca16ba5b912f660378", "ja": "とっても綺麗な涙だったべさ。\nうれし涙って、あんなにまぶしいんだねぇ……。", "zh": "那是非常美丽的泪水呢。  \n原来喜悦的泪水，会那么耀眼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "02bd78953b21d0594425075ee364968965c654f7f4c3fdc76716a3aa27e3b297", "ja": "あたし、あの子がとってもうらやましかったべさ。\nほんとのほんとに、おめでとうって思ったんだよぉ。", "zh": "我真的特别羡慕那孩子。\n发自内心地觉得，恭喜你呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "feb448d9b175b98191d4ee90f66592cd486ddfa36deb69b2626aed92f4eb2903", "ja": "{$P$}。\nあたしも、いつか、あんな涙が流せるかなぁ？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我有一天也能流出那样的眼泪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1030_p", "source_sha256": "40e177f9c0d78d29fe82ad4f555b88ebe8e45a61a9cf3e9415a13f5c40a538a8", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\nそのために、俺がいるんだからな！", "zh": "啊，当然。\n正因为如此，我才会在这里啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "6b6791753fa5013924e8301e59989a70da66bd28f5f204937ac50d3b2361192f", "ja": "{$P$}……えへへ。やっぱし、\n{$P$}の言ったとおりだべさ。", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿。果然，正如{$P$}所说的那样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "06dbc97f25dbfea51073e7ad46815c761ac5d72185f608caf7f5f3bc2a6a3e1e", "ja": "オーディションは、勝っても負けても\n肥やしになるって本当だねぇ。", "zh": "试镜不论胜负都能成为养分，原来是真的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "0d5cf4e1180b1bcf196db991e5134bec5710b12b212d9ca2cd9cf54c716fee8b", "ja": "いい肥やしをありがとうね、{$P$}。\nあたし、次は合格できるようにがんばるよぉ！", "zh": "谢谢你给我这么好的养分，{$P$}。我下次会努力争取合格的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1034_p", "source_sha256": "31cfdda941a606e3ae4a847700a8e5840057b3f05e0a91b7efee92836422c66e", "ja": "（今日のひなたは、負けを悔しがっただけでなく……\nアイドルとして、大切な事を学べたのだと思う）", "zh": "（我想，今天的日向不只是为失败感到懊悔……作为偶像，她也学到了重要的东西。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_035hin_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_035hin_004_1035_p", "source_sha256": "cacf71ed546c8b5502346684f18a7f1cb542918422a8dfea5e2ba99696978795", "ja": "（ひなたなら、今日の悔しさを肥やしに、いつか\n大きな果実を実らせてくれるだろう。絶対に……！）", "zh": "（以日向的性格，一定能把今天的不甘当作养分，总有一天结出硕大的果实。绝对能……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
